<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>FEW-SHOT LEARNING</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 24 }}>FewShot：示例集 = 微型知识库</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 26 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 26px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 14 }}>
          <FAIcon name='copy' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>传统做法：全部塞进去</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
          把几十个示例一股脑拼进 prompt——<br /><br />
          浪费 token、挤占窗口、示例越多越臃肿。
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, background: '#F5F7FA', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", monospace' }}>
            prompt = "示例1... 示例2... 示例50..."
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 26px' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 14 }}>
          <FAIcon name='filter' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>框架做法：语义选示例</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
          <span style={{ color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>SemanticSimilarityExampleSelector</span> 按语义相似度，只挑与当前问题最相关的几个示例——
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, background: 'rgba(255,159,28,0.12)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
            示例集 = 微型知识库，动态检索而非全量堆砌
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 4 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>08 / 14</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
